  "description": "A gridded dataset of Live Fuel Moisture Content (LFMC) estimates across the contiguous United States, derived from Sentinel-1 synthetic aperture radar observations using a SAR-enhanced mapping method. Distributed as Zarr arrays, it supports wildfire risk and vegetation moisture monitoring applications.",
